          "text": "LIBRARY STUDY ROOM POLICY\nRooms may be reserved for up to two hours on weekdays between 9:00 A.M. and 9:00 P.M. Groups must check in within 15 minutes of the reservation time or the room may be released. Each room holds no more than six people. Food is not permitted."
        },
